# Reader TOOLING lock inputs (P6-CI-6 closure): what the required "Revision reader" CI job installs
# into .reader-venv beyond pyproject.toml's own dependencies and its [dev] extra. requirements-dev.txt
# is compiled from pyproject.toml (base + dev) plus this file, with hashes. Never edited by hand.
#   pip        - the installer itself, installed from the lock instead of an unpinned self-upgrade
#   setuptools - the build backend (pyproject [build-system]); the editable install runs with
#                --no-build-isolation so no unpinned build dependency is fetched
#   PyYAML     - the Gate 4N contract, at the exact pin of scripts/requirements-gate.txt
